; A plugin whose strings follow on two indented lines fails at its own
; line's end, and each indented line is an error of its own to beancount,
; unreported so close to the first. The indented open one blank line on is
; fewer than three tokens from the last of them, and is not reported
; either; after two blank lines it is.
plugin
  "beancount.plugins.auto_accounts"
  "{}"

  2020-01-01 open Assets:A

2020-01-02 open Assets:Kept

plugin
  "beancount.plugins.auto_accounts"
  "{}"


  2020-01-03 open Assets:B
